<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26267" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διᾰφύσσω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήφῠσα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw continually,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνον διαφυσσόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.110
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>draw away, tear away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὸν δὲ διήφυσε σαρκὸς ὀδόντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.450
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ δ᾽ ἔντερα χαλκὸς ἤφυσ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.508
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>draw out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χίμετλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					682
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
</div>